{"id":"c9100690e3f1db16","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation.md","title":"L {ω₁ω}  Craig Theorem","display":"thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation — L_{ω₁ω}  Craig Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation","aliases":["57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation"],"display":"thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation — L_{ω₁ω}  Craig Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]","[[57-df-logical-consequence]]","[[57-df-reduct]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation — L_{ω₁ω}  Craig Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a465cae4692d50e\" href=\"?note=7a465cae4692d50e\" title=\"57-df-Lomega1omega\">57-df-Lomega1omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" href=\"?note=d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" title=\"57-df-logical-consequence\">57-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a64ba5f871237a2\" href=\"?note=6a64ba5f871237a2\" title=\"57-df-reduct\">57-df-reduct</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation-—-$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$-Craig-Theorem\">thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\omega_1\\omega}\">\\(L_{\\omega_1\\omega}\\)</span> Craig Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_\\varphi,S_\\psi\">\\(S_\\varphi,S_\\psi\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的两个子字母表，具有一致符号种类与元数；交集继承这些分区并包含共同的变量及逻辑字母。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\varphi)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\varphi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\psi)\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\psi)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a465cae4692d50e\" href=\"?note=7a465cae4692d50e\" title=\"57-df-Lomega1omega\">57-df-Lomega1omega</a>。在并字母表结构上假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\infty\\psi\">\\(\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\infty\\psi\\)</span>；子字母表句子的求值先作约化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\varphi\\cap S_\\psi)\\;\\bigl(\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\infty\\chi\\land\\{\\chi\\}\\models_\\infty\\psi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\varphi\\cap S_\\psi)\\;\\bigl(\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\infty\\chi\\land\\{\\chi\\}\\models_\\infty\\psi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>S_φ 与 S_ψ 是明确给定的子字母表，不再以未定义的自然语言“出现的符号”代替参数。用闭句子避免本书允许无限自由变量的非标准语法所带来的参数闭合歧义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation-—-$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$-Craig-Theorem","text":"thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation — $L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$ Craig Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-Lomega1omega","status":"resolved","id":"7a465cae4692d50e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"6a64ba5f871237a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-reduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-Lomega1omega","status":"resolved","id":"7a465cae4692d50e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_\\varphi,S_\\psi$ 为 $S$ 的两个子字母表，具有一致符号种类与元数；交集继承这些分区并包含共同的变量及逻辑字母。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\varphi)$、$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\psi)$，见 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]]。在并字母表结构上假定 $\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\infty\\psi$；子字母表句子的求值先作约化。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_{\\omega_1\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"S_\\varphi,S_\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\infty\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S_\\varphi\\cap S_\\psi)\\;\\bigl(\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\infty\\chi\\land\\{\\chi\\}\\models_\\infty\\psi\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1195,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-downward-LS]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness]]\n[[57-thm-TP-monotone]]\n[[57-thm-acf-decidable]]\n[[57-thm-adequacy]]\n[[57-thm-assignment-composition]]\n[[57-thm-assignment-idempotent]]\n[[57-thm-back-and-forth-equivalence]]\n[[57-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[57-thm-birkhoff-variety]]\n[[57-thm-church-turing]]\n[[57-thm-church-undecidability]]\n[[57-thm-cnf-existence]]\n[[57-thm-coincidence-formula]]\n[[57-thm-coincidence-term]]\n[[57-thm-compactness]]\n[[57-thm-compactness-coloring]]\n[[57-thm-compactness-entailment]]\n[[57-thm-c